      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.22,
      "end_seconds": 54.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "so, no, nothing to report there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.3,
      "end_seconds": 59.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "on the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.65,
      "end_seconds": 65.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.82,
      "text": "my heart's been fine, as far as I know"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.68,
      "end_seconds": 70.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "let's run through your medicines"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.06,
      "end_seconds": 76.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "I'm on metoprolol, 50 milligrams, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.72,
      "end_seconds": 82.02,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "I see, go ahead. What line of work are you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.4,
      "end_seconds": 92.03,
      "duration_seconds": 5.63,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.13,
      "end_seconds": 100.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.67,
      "end_seconds": 105.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.98,
      "end_seconds": 121.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.53,
      "end_seconds": 127.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.15,
      "text": "Yes, nickel."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.62,
      "end_seconds": 143.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.14,
      "end_seconds": 149.42,
      "duration_seconds": 5.28,
      "text": "yes, uh, I had a triple bypass, eight years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.75,
      "end_seconds": 153.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.49,
      "end_seconds": 157.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "I have heart disease"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.36,
      "end_seconds": 160.26,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "I follow"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 165.51,
      "end_seconds": 178.46,
      "duration_seconds": 12.95,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Respiratory rate 16, pulse is 80 beats a minute, temp 36.5 degrees. Pressure 108 over 68, height 174 centimetres, weight 61 kilos, oxygen saturation is 99 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.18,
      "end_seconds": 179.88,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.32,
      "end_seconds": 186.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.39,
      "end_seconds": 191.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.91,
      "end_seconds": 217.25,
      "duration_seconds": 10.34,
      "text": "There is a firm, mobile, round lump about two centimetres in the upper outer part and no lumps under the arm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.85,
      "end_seconds": 223.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.44,
      "end_seconds": 247.3,
      "duration_seconds": 11.86,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: It fits best with a breast lump needing triple assessment. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.52,
      "end_seconds": 250.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.14,
      "end_seconds": 264.18,
      "duration_seconds": 9.04,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a breast lump needing triple assessment, but I'd like to confirm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.66,
      "end_seconds": 304.77,
      "duration_seconds": 30.11,
      "text": "Let's get a mammogram and ultrasound, for breast lump. I'll request a needle biopsy, it'll help with breast lump. This does not mean cancer, but we do arrange a specialist one-stop clinic to be sure. Please don't wait if the symptoms get worse. That's when to be seen urgently. We'll catch up after the clinic. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.31,
      "end_seconds": 308.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Alright, thanks, take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.34,
      "end_seconds": 311.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
